y Bangkok restaurant shaped by seasonal ingredients and live-fire cooking.","menuTitle":"The Menu","menuDescription":"Seasonal Thai produce, thoughtful cooking, and a little smoke in the air. Explore Maison Ember's current menu.","aboutTitle":"Our Story","aboutDescription":"Meet the people, producers, and fire behind Maison Ember, a Bangkok kitchen rooted in the seasons.","contactTitle":"Visit Us","contactDescription":"Find Maison Ember on Sukhumvit 31 in Bangkok. See our opening hours, contact details, and visit information.","reservationTitle":"Reservations","reservationDescription":"Choose a date, time, and table at Maison Ember in Bangkok.","confirmationTitle":"Reservation received","confirmationDescription":"Your reservation request is with the Maison Ember team."},"home":{"heroEyebrow":"Sukhumvit 31 · Bangkok","heroImageAlt":"The candlelit dining room at Maison Ember","heroTitle":"Gathered\naround <em>fire.</em>","heroDescription":"A table for the seasons. Thoughtful Thai produce, open flame, and the pleasure of staying a little longer.","heroHours":"Evenings, Tuesday to Sunday","heroUntil":"17:30 until late","scroll":"Find your table","bookingEyebrow":"A seat by the fire","bookingTitle":"Make an evening\nof it.","bookingIntro":"Choose a date and we’ll find a place for you.","largePartyLead":"For parties of nine or more,","contactTeam":"speak with our team","date":"Date","time":"Time","guests":"Guests","menuEyebrow":"The kitchen, in season","menuTitle":"Good things\nmeet the <em>flame.</em>","menuCopy":"We cook what’s at its best, then let good ingredients speak for themselves. The menu changes with the market and the mood of the season.","seeMenu":"See the full menu","menuPhotoAlt":"Seasonal ingredients cooking over an open flame","photoNote":"Over charcoal, every evening","dishList":"From the menu","aLaCarte":"À la carte · from {price}","dishMore":"A longer look at the menu","storyEyebrow":"A little about us","storyTitle":"Rooted here.\nOpen to <em>everywhere.</em>","storyOne":"Maison Ember began with a simple idea: cook close to the source, gather people around the kitchen, and give the evening room to unfold.","storyTwo":"Our fire brings together small farms, coastal fishers, and the bright, generous flavours of Thailand. Nothing hurried; everything shared.","storyLink":"Our story","storyAlt":"Our chef tending the open kitchen at Maison Ember","storyFootnote":"A kitchen led by the season","galleryEyebrow":"The evening, as it is","galleryTitle":"Come as the light\nstarts to <em>change.</em>","galleryLink":"Inside Maison Ember","galleryMainAlt":"An intimate dinner set in the warm glow of candlelight","galleryMainCaption":"Slow evenings, shared plates","galleryWineAlt":"A glass of red wine poured for dinner","galleryWineCaption":"Something lovely in the glass","galleryNote":"Thoughtful sourcing, familiar flavours, and a little smoke in the air.","findBangkok":"Find us in Bangkok","philosophy":"Dinner should be an occasion, and an easy one.","philosophyAttribution":"The Maison Ember philosophy","closingEyebrow":"Your evening is waiting","closingTitle":"We’ll keep a\n<em>place for you.</em>","location":"27 Soi Sukhumvit 31, Bangkok","closingHours":"Tuesday to Sunday · From 17:30","metaOgTitle":"Maison Ember — A Bangkok Fire Kitchen","metaOgDescription":"Seasonal cooking, shaped by fire. Find a table in the heart of Bangkok."},"menu":{"categoriesLabel":"Menu categories","eyebrow":"The menu · September 2026","title":"From market\nto <em>ember.</em>","intro":"Our menu follows the season and the fire. Dishes are made for sharing, the way a good evening should be.","dietary":"Ask about dietary needs","photoAlt":"A seasonal dish, finished over the wood fire","photoCaption":"Wood, smoke, and what’s good right now","category1":"To begin","category2":"From the fire","category3":"A little after","categoryHint1":"A first taste","categoryHint2":"Over charcoal, every evening","categoryHint3":"A softer ending","tagShellfish":"Shellfish","tagPlant":"Plant based","tagForTwo":"For two","tagDaily":"Daily catch","disclaimer":"Please let us know about allergies when booking. Our kitchen handles all major allergens, so we can’t guarantee an entirely allergen-free dish.","items":{"scallop":{"name":"Charred Hokkaido Scallop","description":"Brown butter, young coconut, finger lime"},"tomato":{"name":"Tomato & Green Mango","description":"Heirloom tomato, nahm jim, toasted rice"},"marrow":{"name":"Wood-roasted Bone Marrow","description":"Sourdough, smoked shallot, parsley"},"duck":{"name":"Dry-aged Duck Breast","description":"Black garlic, seasonal greens, tamarind jus"},"wagyu":{"name":"Ember Wagyu","description":"Wood-fired wagyu, smoked onion, red wine"},"fish":{"name":"Market Fish","description":"Banana leaf, turmeric, charred lime"},"cheesecake":{"name":"Burnt Basque Cheesecake","description":"Palm sugar, cultured cream"},"cacao":{"name":"Cacao & Coffee","description":"70% Thai cacao, espresso, sea salt"}}},"about":{"eyebrow":"A kitchen with a point of view","title":"Closer to the\n<em>source.</em>","intro":"Maison Ember is a place to slow down, eat well, and feel at home in the heart of Bangkok.","imageAlt":"The Maison Ember team preparing dinner in the open kitchen","way":"The way we cook","established":"Est. 2021\nBangkok, Thailand","heading":"Good cooking begins\nlong before the <em>flame.</em>","paragraph1":"It begins in the soil, with people who know their land. We work with small growers and fishers across Thailand, taking what is ready and letting it shape our menu.","paragraph2":"Then we bring it close to the fire. Wood and charcoal lend their own quiet character, drawing out the sweetness, the smoke, the edges worth sharing.","paragraph3":"We believe hospitality is a kind of attention: remembering what matters, making space at the table, and never rushing the last glass.","comeSit":"Come sit with us","value1Title":"In season","value1Copy":"Menus follow the market, with Thai produce at the heart of every plate.","value2Title":"Over fire","value2Copy":"Wood and charcoal bring out the honest character of each ingredient.","value3Title":"At the table","value3Copy":"Unhurried, generous hospitality. There’s always room for one more."},"contact":{"eyebrow":"An evening in Bangkok","title":"Find your\n<em>way here.</em>","intro":"Just off Sukhumvit, a little away from the rush. We’ll have the fire going.","imageAlt":"Maison Ember's softly lit dining room","addressEyebrow":"Our address","addressName":"Maison Ember","address":"27 Soi Sukhumvit 31, Watthana, Bangkok 10110","openMaps":"Open in maps","phoneEyebrow":"A human voice","phoneTitle":"We’re here to help.","largeParty":"For parties of 9 or more, give us a call.","hoursEyebrow":"Opening hours","hoursTueThu":"Tuesday – Thursday","hoursFriSun":"Friday – Sunday","hoursMonday":"Monday","hoursTueThuTime":"17:30 – 23:00","hoursFriSunTime":"17:30 – 00:00","gettingHere":"Getting here","gettingCopy":"A short walk from Phrom Phong BTS. Valet parking is available at the entrance; street parking is limited.","dress":"What to wear","dressCopy":"Come as you are, just as long as you’re comfortable. Smart casual is always at home here.","smallNote":"A small note","policy":"We’ll hold your table for 15 minutes. Please call if your plans change or you need to cancel.","closingEyebrow":"We’ll put the kettle on","closingTitle":"See you <em>soon?</em>"},"reservation":{"eyebrow":"An evening worth keeping","title":"Let’s make a\n<em>reservation.</em>","intro":"We look forward to having you at our table.","steps":{"group":"Your evening","date":"Date & guests","time":"Time & seating","details":"Your details","review":"Review","count":"0{step} <span>/</span> 04"},"date":{"eyebrow":"01 / The occasion","title":"When shall we\n<em>expect you?</em>","intro":"An evening at Maison Ember starts with a good date and good company.","label":"Date","partyLabel":"Number of guests","required":"Required","hours":"We’re open Tuesday through Sunday.","sameDay":"Same-day reservations close at 16:00."},"time":{"eyebrow":"02 / Make it yours","title":"Choose your\n<em>place by the fire.</em>","times":"Available times","timezone":"All times local · Bangkok","available":"Available","limited":"Few tables left","full":"Fully booked","legendAvailable":"Available","legendLimited":"Few tables","legendFull":"Unavailable","seating":"Seating preference","selected":"Selected"},"seating":{"dining":"Dining room","diningDetail":"The warmth of the room","terrace":"Garden terrace","terraceDetail":"Open air, weather permitting","counter":"Chef’s counter","counterDetail":"Please contact us to request","byRequest":"By request","notSelected":"To be selected"},"details":{"eyebrow":"03 / The name on the table","title":"Who are we\n<em>welcoming?</em>","intro":"Just a few details, so we can make your evening feel like yours.","first":"First name","last":"Last name","email":"Email address","phone":"Phone number","occasion":"Are you celebrating?","none":"No particular occasion","birthday":"Birthday","anniversary":"Anniversary","business":"Business dinner","dateNight":"Date night","other":"Other","occasionHint":"A small detail helps us take better care of you.","requests":"Anything we should know?","requestsPlaceholder":"Allergies, access needs, or a note for the kitchen…","requestsHint":"We’ll do our best to accommodate your request."},"review":{"eyebrow":"04 / Before the first course","title":"Everything in\n<em>its place.</em>","intro":"A final look. Your table is one thoughtful click away.","dateTime":"Date & time","table":"Your table","for":"Reservation for","note":"A note for the team","editDate":"Edit date","editTable":"Edit table","policy":"We hold your table for 15 minutes. For changes or cancellations, please call us at {phone}.","call":"Call us","confirm":"Confirm Reservation"},"summary":{"eyebrow":"The details","title":"Your table,\n<em>at a glance.</em>","when":"When","guests":"Guests","seating":"Seating","help":"Need a hand?","